---
const principles = [
  {
    title: 'Senior-only',
    description: 'No junior handoffs, no account managers relaying your requirements badly. You work with the people doing the work.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Opinionated by design',
    description: 'We have a stack we trust and a way we build. We\'ll tell you when we think you\'re wrong.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Small on purpose',
    description: 'We stay small enough that nothing gets lost between what you asked for and what ships.',
  },
];
---

<div class="about">
  <p class="about-lead lead">
    Imagile is a small firm of senior engineers. We teach AI fluency, build
    production .NET and Azure systems, and advise startups betting on
    getting technology right.
  </p>

  <div class="principles">
    {principles.map(p => (
      <div class="principle">
        <h3>{p.title}</h3>
        <p>{p.description}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .about-lead {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .principle p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .principles {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
